      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "确实现在，在长距离中能与目白麦昆较量的赛马娘\n几乎没有了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d699395c90adc6501a7ab9546014c1eb4fefbd850ef871f63d912f25ee08ee2",
